[{"id":"IU_12","ref":"12","section":"The eighteen mantras","sa":["अन्धं तमः प्रविशन्ति येऽसम्भूतिमुपासते ।","ततो भूय इव ते तमो य उ सम्भूत्यां रताः ॥१२॥"],"iast":["andhaṃ tamaḥ praviśanti ye’sambhūtimupāsate ।","tato bhūya iva te tamo ya u sambhūtyāṃ ratāḥ ॥12॥"],"alt":[{"text":"Into a blind darkness they enter who follow after the Non-Birth, they as if into a greater darkness who devote themselves to the Birth alone.","by":"Sri Aurobindo","cite":"Sri Aurobindo · CWSA 17, p. 8","source":"upanishads.org.in"}],"words":[["अन्धम्","andham","blind","andha"],["तमः","tamaḥ","darkness","tamas"],["प्रविशन्ति","praviśanti","they enter","√viś"],["ये","ye","who","ya"],["असम्भूतिम्","asambhūtim","the Non-Birth","asambhūti"],["उपासते","upāsate","follow after","√upās"],["ततः","tataḥ","Thence","tataḥ"],["भूयः","bhūyaḥ","greater","bhūyaḥ"],["इव","iva","as if","iva"],["ते","te","they","ta"],["तमः","tamaḥ","darkness","tamas"],["ये","ye","who","yad"],["उ","u","indeed","u"],["सम्भूत्याम्","sambhūtyām","in Birth","sambhūti"],["रताः","ratāḥ","devote themselves","rata"]],"tr":{"text":"To pitch darkness they go who worship the Unmanifested (Prakriti). To a greater darkness than this go those who are devoted to the Manifested (Hiranyagarbha).","by":"Vidyavachaspati V. Panoli","source":"108 Upanishads (comp. R. Sheppard)"},"audio":{"mp3":"https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/upanishaddata/SplitAudio/Isopanisad/1.12.mp3","whole":[193.61,208.9]},"hasBhashya":false,"order":13,"up":"isha"}]